WEBVTT

00:01.200 --> 00:03.000
NIGHT CLERK: Evening.

00:03.300 --> 00:07.600
NIGHT CLERK: Found something special in the returns.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.200
NIGHT CLERK: Do mind the label.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
COLLECTOR: Let's see what you are.

00:54.000 --> 00:56.000
COLLECTOR: What?

01:41.000 --> 01:45.800
THE VISITOR: You forgot to rewind.

01:52.400 --> 01:55.000
NIGHT CLERK: Another satisfied customer.

01:55.200 --> 01:57.800
NIGHT CLERK: Membership... permanent.
